        },
        {
          "text": "Man malaika ma kwong’ane kudho agwara, m’ulubo maeno pei ku mac, m’ujebre ku rimo, man jubologi wi ng’om: man theng ng’om mir adege wang’ pet, man mir adege mi yedhi de wang’ pet, man lum ceke ma numu wang’ pet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.7",
