          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E aneno, man awinjo acur acel, m’eberingo i kor polo, m’ebewacu ku dwal ma dit kumae, Can, can, can, ni ju m’ubedo wi ng’om, kum dwal mange mir agwara mi malaika adek, ma gibikudho agwara macen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.13",
